     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet reason-for-no-method-at-exit-values</b></p><a name=\"reason-for-no-method-at-exit-values\"> </a><a name=\"hcreason-for-no-method-at-exit-values\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/14550-0/\">14550-0</a></td><td>Voluntarily refrains from sexual intercourse</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA 27925-9/\">LA 27925-9</a></td><td>Same sex partner</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/46-8/\">46-8</a></td><td>No method for other reasons</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/27927-5/\">27927-5</a></td><td>Sterile for non-contraceptive reasons</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA 27928-3/\">LA 27928-3</a></td><td>Seeking pregnancy</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/454731000124108\">454731000124108</a></td><td>Voluntarily refrains from sexual intercourse</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/445637007\">445637007</a></td><td>Client choice to not use contraception</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/454361000124100\">454361000124100</a></td><td>Same sex partner</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://sn